      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Wattspur on the iPhone no longer reads rides from a folder. Your rides are on your Mac: turn on Sync with iCloud, here under More and on the Mac under Wattspur › Settings › iCloud, and they come to this iPhone. Rides recorded here stay on this iPhone until then; “Share GPX” takes one to the Mac.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 191
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Backup Not Restored",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 50,
          "startingLine": 273
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Backup Restored",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 16,
          "startingLine": 274
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "OK",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 20,
          "startingLine": 196
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "The library is now the backup from %@. The library before it is kept in a folder “Library Before Restore …”.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 280
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "iCloud now brings your other devices to the same state; give it a few minutes.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 53,
          "startingLine": 281
        }
      },
      {
